contentMarkdown:
This is the shape of a classical card holder with 1 central pocket and 2 side pockets.

You can put between 3 and 5 cards in there.

This is made for people in love with minimalist lifestyle and don't bother with useless cards and stuff in there pocket.

[🎨 Play with the colours](https://lord.crofte.fr/leather-color-picker/?c2=brown&c1=blue&p=2)

Ask for leather and thread colors customisation.

